- Two MCP servers

      if (model.api.id.includes("5.") || model.api.id.includes("5-mini")) {
        return { store: false, reasoningEffort: "low" }
      }

It will set it to low

Additional context on the agent config — at the time of the error, the `orchestrator` agent was set to:

```json
"agent": {
  "orchestrator": {
    "model": "github-copilot/claude-opus-4.7",
    "reasoningEffort": "medium",
    "mode": "primary"
  }
}
```

(custom `prompt` omitted — the rest of the spec is standard)

This is why the log shows `agent=orchestrator modelID=claude-opus-4.7` — it was a custom primary agent backed by `opus-4.7` with `medium` reasoning effort. The `output_config: { effort: "medium" }` was being sent on every request because of the `reasoningEffort: "medium"` setting.
